{
  "ledger": [
    "00:00 — Subject: woman leaning on hood, arms crossed, facing camera. True mirrors in frame: car rearview mirror (seen through windshield) and driver-side exterior mirror. Rearview mirror face is too small/dark to resolve any reflection; side mirror faces rearward and shows only road/desert, not the subject. Subject's image appears only in windshield glass — out of scope.",
    "00:02 — Subject: same arms-crossed pose on hood, head slightly turned. Rearview and side mirrors still present; neither resolves a reflection of the subject. Windshield shows only landscape/sky reflection (glass, out of scope).",
    "00:04 — Subject: arms crossed, leaning, gazing left. Rearview mirror visible through windshield but reflection unreadable at this size; side mirror no longer clearly resolvable. No comparable true-mirror image of the subject exists at this instant.",
    "00:06 — Subject: arms crossed, hair blowing, looking toward road, smiling. Rearview mirror no longer clearly in frame; windshield shows glare only (glass, out of scope). No true-mirror reflection available for comparison.",
    "00:08 — Subject: close-up, arms crossed on hood, hair blowing. No mirror face visible anywhere in frame. No true-mirror reflection available. Inventory verification: the only true mirrors in the video are the vehicle's rearview and exterior side mirrors; neither ever displays a resolvable reflection of the subject, and the only subject reflections present are in windshield/window glass, which is excluded by scope. Zero comparable moments."
  ],
